This product carries six published structure-prediction models behind one JAX
interface. Five models are reimplemented in JAX; AlphaFold 3 carries upstream's
own source. The reimplementations still carry some upstream source where their
input pipelines need it: Boltz-2's preprocessing under `models/boltz2/data/` is
adapted from Boltz, OpenFold3's data pipeline under
`models/openfold3/_upstream/` is vendored, and ESMFold2's residue constants and
paired-MSA helper come from Biohub's code; each is identified below and in that
port's NOTICE. None is an official project of the organisation that published
the original, and no model weights are distributed with this software.

THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES lists every carried third-party file with its licence and
copyright, including code those upstreams themselves copied (Biotite, in the
OpenFold3 pipeline), and the installed dependencies whose terms are not
